      "writtenOn": "2022-04-04T09:14:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the info. Adding any build unique id is not going to fly for the reasons you stated. I\u0027ll abandon this direction and write up a design doc on how to build up indexes so we can map this externally.",
